# Cấu Hình Environment Variables

## Frontend (.env.local)

```env
# ============================================
# BANK ACCOUNT INFO (Manual Transfer)
# ============================================
VITE_BANK_ACCOUNT_NUMBER=1234567890
VITE_BANK_NAME=Techcombank
VITE_BANK_ACCOUNT_HOLDER=NGUYEN VAN A

# ============================================
# SMS CONFIRMATION API
# ============================================
VITE_SMS_CONFIRM_API_KEY=your-super-secret-api-key-here

# ============================================
# PAYOS (DISABLED - For future use)
# ============================================
# VITE_PAYOS_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id
# VITE_PAYOS_API_KEY=your_api_key
# VITE_PAYOS_CHECKSUM_KEY=your_checksum_key
# VITE_PAYOS_API_URL=https://api-merchant.payos.vn/v2
# VITE_PAYOS_WEBHOOK_URL=https://your-domain.com/api/payos-webhook
# VITE_PAYOS_RETURN_URL=https://your-domain.com/wallet?topup=success
# VITE_PAYOS_CANCEL_URL=https://your-domain.com/wallet?topup=cancelled
```

## Backend (Express/Node.js)

```env
# .env
SMS_CONFIRM_API_KEY=your-super-secret-api-key-here
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
```

## Supabase Edge Function

```bash
# Set via Supabase CLI
supabase secrets set SMS_CONFIRM_API_KEY=your-super-secret-api-key-here
```

---

## Security Notes

1. **Never commit `.env.local` to git!**
   - Add to `.gitignore`

2. **Generate strong API key:**
   ```bash
   # Linux/Mac
   openssl rand -base64 32
   
   # Windows PowerShell
   [Convert]::ToBase64String((1..32|%{Get-Random -Max 256}))
   ```

3. **Bank account info:**
   - Thay số tài khoản thật của bạn
   - Tên ngân hàng chính xác
   - Tên chủ TK viết HOA, không dấu

4. **API key phải giống nhau:**
   - Frontend `VITE_SMS_CONFIRM_API_KEY`
   - Backend `SMS_CONFIRM_API_KEY`
   - Android app config

---

